   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["g", "TI"], ",", " ", 
    StyleBox["c", "TI"]}], "]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "678997b4-55dc-448e-a95c-e50759360da2"],
 "\[LineSeparator]",
 "gives the spray at ",
 StyleBox["c", "TI"],
 ": the directed acyclic graph of all shortest paths from ",
 StyleBox["c", "TI"],
 ".",
 "\n",
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"55d764d1-ecd7-4a54-9a65-399d654a7a58"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   TemplateBox[{
     Cell[
      TextData["SprayGraph"]], 
     "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/SprayGraph", 
     "WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry Package Symbol"},
    "PackageLink",
    BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"], "[", 
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["g", "TI"], ",", " ", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["c1", "TI"], ",", " ", 
      StyleBox["c2", "TI"], ",", " ", "\[Ellipsis]"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "c43f070f-eb4e-4166-afc5-933a901dbdfb"],
 "\[LineSeparator]",
 "gives the spray of the vertex set, with the distance to the nearest ",
 StyleBox["ci", "TI"],
 ".",
 "\n",
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"ea6bd69e-2a82-4670-9bd0-c2ca24fea39f"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   TemplateBox[{
     Cell[
      TextData["SprayGraph"]], 
     "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/SprayGraph", 
     "WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry Package Symbol"},
    "PackageLink",
    BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"], "[", 
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["g", "TI"], ",", " ", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
        StyleBox["u1", "TI"], ",", " ", 
        StyleBox["v1", "TI"]}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
        StyleBox["u2", "TI"], ",", " ", 
        StyleBox["v2", "TI"]}], "}"}], ",", " ", "\[Ellipsis]"}], "}"}]}], 
   "]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "b85fadef-ec6b-436b-9042-ae7634b52c31"],
 "\[LineSeparator]",
 "gives the union of shortest paths from each ",
 StyleBox["ui", "TI"],
 " to ",
 StyleBox["vi", "TI"],
 "."
}], "Usage",ExpressionUUID->"ec3efe97-b723-4e64-94b0-4679675196d9"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The spray at ",
 StyleBox["c", "TI"],
 " has an edge ",
 StyleBox["u \[RightArrow] v", "TI"],
 " for every edge ",
 StyleBox["uv", "TI"],
 " of ",
 StyleBox["g", "TI"],
 " with ",
 StyleBox["d(c, v) = d(c, u) + 1", "TI"],
 ". Edges inside one shell about ",
 StyleBox["c", "TI"],
 " are dropped."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"949b2c9d-4be5-4d36-9b22-3889f9ad2d55"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The directed paths from ",
 StyleBox["c", "TI"],
 " are exactly the shortest paths from ",
 StyleBox["c", "TI"],
 ". The paths from ",
 StyleBox["c", "TI"],
 " to a sink are the maximal ones: a sink is a vertex with no neighbour \
farther from ",
 StyleBox["c", "TI"],
 ". The spray is the graph analogue of the exponential map at ",
 StyleBox["c", "TI"],
 "."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"ed8c65ec-ade0-4bd6-9564-c683a118c8fb"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "On a bipartite graph such as the square grid no edge lies inside a shell, \
so the spray keeps every edge of ",
 StyleBox["g", "TI"],
 "."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"89d10eac-85a2-40bd-9ec6-2926d667632d"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "With several sources ",
 StyleBox["d(c, v)", "TI"],
 " is replaced by ",
 StyleBox["d(C, v) = min d(c\:1d62, v)", "TI"],
 "."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"44b9766a-606d-48d9-b6d7-c0adf5e9f836"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The pair form picks shortest paths from each ",
 StyleBox["u\:1d62", "TI"],
 " to ",
 StyleBox["v\:1d62", "TI"],
 " and takes the union of their path graphs."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"2047df68-dc6f-4172-b7e7-a6146ccdb8f6"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The spray keeps the vertex coordinates of ",
 StyleBox["g", "TI"],
 "."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"71a662d2-68d1-4e2e-be22-1bda953c2655"],

Cell["Options:", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"81a67b2d-f9e7-4574-bb4f-ca4f9124c327"],

